# Phase indexes

`FASE_1.md`, `FASE_2.md`, `FASE_3.md` are perennial maps.

## Required pattern

- Short phase goal in PT-BR
- Point to README for the fixed study loop (do not duplicate long daily instructions)
- Per-subject sections with markdown task lists:

```markdown
- [ ] [Dia 01 — Título](fase-1/fisica/dia-01-slug.md)
```

## Rules

- Use **relative** links that resolve in Docsify from repo root
- When adding/renaming/reordering days, update the matching `FASE_n.md` in the same change
- Placeholders for empty subjects are allowed until content exists
